{"data": [{"author_id": "1859075762579795969", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:54:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114264364140376420"], "id": "2114264364140376420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，\n全国出生人口达792万人，\n出生率为5.63‰，\n自然增长率为-2.41‰。\n2021-2025年，中国年度出生人口数分别是1062万人、956万人、902万人、954万人和792万人。\n新生人口中，男孩占比仍较多，但性别结构出现边际改善。\n2025年，广东省出生人口为100.3万人，", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoliang2027/status/2114264364140376420"}, {"author_id": "3315697506", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:13:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113997269041398175"], "id": "2113997269041398175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 325, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2024年中国全年出生人口954万\n\n2025年中国全年出生人口792万\n\n以后学校还怎么搞哦！ \n\n大家觉得2026年还会下降吗？", "url": "https://x.com/soap628/status/2113997269041398175"}, {"author_id": "2051952585138143232", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:39:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114260631792800198"], "id": "2114260631792800198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114041984830849348", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不仅1-9月份的出生人口已经触目惊心\n\n别忘了怀胎要10个月，\n也就是说3月份之后怀孕开始做产检的人数，基本就是明年出生人口的上限！这个数字可能更加刺激😆 https://t.co/1ufb42p88C", "url": "https://x.com/quinnoutlook/status/2114260631792800198"}, {"author_id": "869544895538544640", "created_at": "2026-10-24T04:23:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113848796455006523"], "id": "2113848796455006523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 13563, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "李强在国务院常务会议指出，要加快建设生育友好型社会，持续完善婚嫁、生育、养育、教育等政策，优化面向家庭的财税、社保、住房等支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。\n\n稳定新出生人口规模，亡羊补牢，已经晚了！", "url": "https://x.com/dyw1968316/status/2113848796455006523"}, {"author_id": "1881643440234201088", "created_at": "2026-10-25T10:05:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114297181821956402"], "id": "2114297181821956402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年出生人口数据出来了\n\n每出生100个女孩，大约有111个男孩\n\n本来出生人口就在减少，男孩还比女孩多\n\n突然有点替这批男孩子担心了\n\n小时候卷成绩，长大了卷工作\n\n以后找个对象，估计还得继续卷\n\n这一代男孩子，感觉还没出生就开始竞争了", "url": "https://x.com/henryleewant/status/2114297181821956402"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:49:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114338604772388877"], "id": "2114338604772388877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，中国出生人口792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。其中，仅有7个省份2025年人口自然增长率为正，这7个省份位于西部地区和华南地区，分别是西藏、新疆、广东、宁夏、贵州、海南、青海。", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2114338604772388877"}, {"author_id": "869544895538544640", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:26:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114000523196088561"], "id": "2114000523196088561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 7249, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "31省份2025年人口出生率公布，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。只有7个省区人口正增长，分别是西藏、新疆、广东、宁夏、贵州、海南、青海，除了广东，都是边疆省份。\n人口自然增长率为负数，表明死亡人口大于出生人口。\n这才是中国人口的真正危机。 https://t.co/NR2yS4oXiH", "url": "https://x.com/dyw1968316/status/2114000523196088561"}, {"author_id": "1893880809821736960", "created_at": "2026-10-24T07:13:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113891726406332572"], "id": "2113891726406332572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国务院常务会议提出，要加快建设生育友好型社会，优化面向家庭的财税、社保、住房等支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。面对出生人口持续下降，政策进一步加码，覆盖婚嫁、生育、养育、教育全链条。专家建议提高育儿补贴、延长年限、按物价调整个税扣除等。👶📈\n\n#生育政策 #人口 https://t.co/SJ4ZnzJdMz", "url": "https://x.com/GamePanda319135/status/2113891726406332572"}, {"author_id": "1324566469", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:23:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113984620199071982"], "id": "2113984620199071982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 192, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模😄 https://t.co/wBOgf5mOop", "url": "https://x.com/mtans_sh/status/2113984620199071982"}, {"author_id": "2112068973969965056", "created_at": "2026-10-24T10:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113946892170379454"], "id": "2113946892170379454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国每8个新生儿，就有1个出生在广东\n你猜你们省排第几，出生率是高还是低\n国家统计局《中国统计年鉴2026》刚公布了2025年31个省份的人口出生率\n2025年全国出生人口792万人，出生率5.63‰，自然增长率为负2.41‰\n有9个省份出生率超过7‰，分别是西藏、贵州、新疆、宁夏、青海、广东、海南、云南和广西", "url": "https://x.com/susan16808/status/2113946892170379454"}, {"author_id": "1260553941714186241", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113986367072219353"], "id": "2113986367072219353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 50966, "like_count": 134, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "1905175803840942142", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "李强：努力稳定新生人口规模\n\n10月23日，中国总理李强主持国务院常务会议，提出要加快建设生育友好型社会，完善婚嫁、生育、养育、教育等政策，并优化财税、社保及住房等家庭支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。\n\n2025年中国全年出生人口仅792万，较2024年的954万骤减162万，创数十年来最低水平。 https://t.co/L8yM7hbkaU https://t.co/4MA4IP2k4Q", "url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113986367072219353"}, {"author_id": "1921437096688173056", "created_at": "2026-10-24T16:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114037955807649833"], "id": "2114037955807649833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 946, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "过去中国对内经济增长很大程度上依赖三大引擎：房地产、土地财政和地方基建。\n\n这三者有一个共同特征——通过 “信用扩张”，把未来的 “需求” 提前释放到当下。\n\n当人口红利、地产红利和出口红利逐步减弱后，旧增长模式创造的现金流已难以覆盖存量债务，于是系统开始越来越依赖借新债维持运转。 https://t.co/83GdFREU0L", "url": "https://x.com/4gU8m/status/2114037955807649833"}, {"author_id": "2080882539779272704", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:46:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114352980019630528"], "id": "2114352980019630528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 219, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114352609448566900", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "人口出生率下降太恐怖了，内蒙古年出生人口不足10万了！ https://t.co/jgN9jrIlLS https://t.co/ktKhfiyMzy", "url": "https://x.com/meigubige/status/2114352980019630528"}, {"author_id": "2042160708826083328", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:05:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114191616475004941"], "id": "2114191616475004941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全年，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。 https://t.co/qMg5wh3bG1", "url": "https://x.com/MarcusLoveone/status/2114191616475004941"}, {"author_id": "1904976024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:12:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114329310790398125"], "id": "2114329310790398125", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 230, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不懂就问！中国出生人口怎么降得这么厉害？\n\n是因为年轻人都不做爱了吗？ https://t.co/w7zJAPPFHb", "url": "https://x.com/xie_Dl/status/2114329310790398125"}, {"author_id": "166476172", "created_at": "2026-10-24T07:21:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113893684844302357"], "id": "2113893684844302357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 22057, "like_count": 71, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "10月23日，李强主持国务院常务会议，提出优化面向家庭的社保、住房等支持政策，努力稳定出生人口规模。\n\n但中国养老金面临的现实是：领取养老金的人越来越多，缴费的劳动人口却在减少。\n\n几个关键数字：\n\n2020年，全国社会保险基金支出5.47万亿元；2025年增至7.74万亿元，五年增加2.27万亿元。", "url": "https://x.com/wongkim728/status/2113893684844302357"}, {"author_id": "2059833506729959429", "created_at": "2026-10-24T02:25:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113819140201038068"], "id": "2113819140201038068", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 255, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在国内出生人口数据差到开始发补贴了的地步了。\n\n一年3600，应该是想试水看韭菜们要上当了不。", "url": "https://x.com/Xqqc1w/status/2113819140201038068"}, {"author_id": "1631837417790640128", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:51:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113931025256706423", "2113931386449231898"], "id": "2113931386449231898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新目标是努力稳定出生人口\n\n既不是必须稳定，也不是努力增长\n\n说明这就不是个事 https://t.co/aPNYKUQtbt", "url": "https://x.com/poorpela/status/2113931386449231898"}, {"author_id": "761100642282713089", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113950424827150664"], "id": "2113950424827150664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1791, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全国结婚登记676.51万对，比上年增长10.8％。\n\n可明年是羊年啊，出生人口大概率还是创新低吧。", "url": "https://x.com/Wujizhuzhu/status/2113950424827150664"}, {"author_id": "2093708410902773760", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:08:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113950842583965971"], "id": "2113950842583965971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 269, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国都在为结婚率、生育率发愁。\n\n广东却在出生人口上持续领跑。\n\n同样是高房价、高压力，\n\n为什么广东还能生？", "url": "https://x.com/Beyond939/status/2113950842583965971"}, {"author_id": "2039794382472105984", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:17:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113801972457656415"], "id": "2113801972457656415", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 822, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不懂就问 努力稳定出生人口 \n\n这他妈谁想出来的 怎么稳定\n\n意思要通知以后只能内射吗？？？ https://t.co/pmWE4C7kra", "url": "https://x.com/HaibingT48420/status/2113801972457656415"}, {"author_id": "1134614241103581184", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:39:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113807600055906404"], "id": "2113807600055906404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 955, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "他们又开始建设生育友好型社会了，\n\n要努力稳定新出生人口规模····\n\n看来，韭菜不生软肋的决策相当正确！ https://t.co/St0baiQoTJ", "url": "https://x.com/huang3feng/status/2113807600055906404"}, {"author_id": "1821498733248540672", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:27:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114046025673650228"], "id": "2114046025673650228", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 190, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国全年出生人口仅792万，较\n\n2024年的954万骤减162万，创数十年来\n\n最低水平。这年头一般人谁还生小孩出\n\n来当牛做马。", "url": "https://x.com/qingwng51958911/status/2114046025673650228"}, {"author_id": "861236976216944641", "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:10:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114147529285894529"], "id": "2114147529285894529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 529, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年的人口数据📊\n\n2025年全国出生人口792万人，\n\n出生率为 5.63‰ ，自然增长率为 \n\n-2.41‰ 。  请注意：是千分之\n\n人口下降，势不可挡…", "url": "https://x.com/mecypu/status/2114147529285894529"}, {"author_id": "1904976024", "created_at": "2026-10-25T09:48:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114292994203636052"], "id": "2114292994203636052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 190, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "天塌了！中国出生人口暴跌\n\n多地幼儿园改为养老院\n\n马斯克和赵长鹏这些富人不停生\n\n你